 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 72.13pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 75.11pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">대학원생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">(석？박사)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 317.58pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 75.11pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 학비마련에 어려움이 있는 가계곤란 학생으로 해당 대학원의 심사 결과 선정된 학생(스마일장학금 신청자에 한함)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 16.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ 소득 5분위 이내의 학생을 선발하되, 장학금 재원에 따라 7분위까지 확대하여 선발</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 81.33pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 75.11pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-RIGHT: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">일반대학원 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-RIGHT: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">산업대학원 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-RIGHT: 14pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">교육대학원 </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 선발순위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가구별/소득수준별 건강보험료 산정기준표</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">〔서식2〕</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp; <font color=\"#747474\">1)&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#747474\">1</font>순위 : 기초생활수급자, 본인장애급수 1급 ~ 3급</span></font></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 2)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2순위 : 차상위계층 및 의료급여수급자&nbsp;</span></font></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><font color=\"#747474\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 3)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3순위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">소득 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1~5분위 이하 또는 건강보험료가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">전국가구 평균소득 100%이하 가구</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#747474\">&nbsp; 4)4순위 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font color=\"#8c8c8c\"><font color=\"#747474\">소득</font> </font>6</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">~7분위 이하 또는 건강보험료가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">전국가구 평균소득 120%이하 가구</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ 소득 1~7분위 선발순위 : 저소득자 순으로 선발</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"전 조문\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼엑스포; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼엑스포; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼엑스포\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 지급방법 : 등록금 고지면제</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼엑스포; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼엑스포; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼엑스포\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 장학금액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">가.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">